  "verseCount": 34,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "16",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LEV 16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "16",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rituko Rinene ri’ogokora Okobwatanigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ogokwa kw’abamura baria babere ba Aroni baitetwe n’Omonene, ekero bamorenterete omorero bw’engencho eng’ao, oyio batachigetwe, Omonene agakwana na Musa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akamoteebia, “Teebia Aroni, momura omino, ng’a tabaisa gosoa ime y’Aase Aachenu Mono, moino y’etoto, bosio bw’Oboikaranso bwa amaabera obore ekemumeko gi’Esanduki eria, engaki ende yonsi, ekiagera agwo nao ngochia kooroka ime ye riire igoro y’Oboikaranso obwo bwa amaabera. Aise gokora bo, goika akwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Igo arasoe ime y’Aase Aachenu Mono magega karentire eeri ensae ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, na emingichi ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ritang’ani Aroni atarasoa Aase Aachenu Mono, goika esibie omobere oye namaache, amanye kobeeka chianga chiria chinchenu: Eganchwa erobekanirie eigete inse, ne chisirwari, na orokini, na ekegogwa, bionsi biroisirie korwa ase egatani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Erio Aroni aegwe korwa ase omoganda bw’Abaisraeli chigoree ibere chibe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, na emingichi eyemo ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ritang’ani arue eeri ebe ekeng’wanso ase ogokora okobwatanigwa asere omonyene, na ase abanto b’enka yaye, erinde baaberwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende arente chigoree chiria ibere ase obosio bwane inche Omonene agwo ase egesoero ki’Eema y’Omosangererekano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agwo Aroni aake obomera igoro ye chigoree chiria ibere, obomera obomo ase ’nde, na obonde ase Asaseli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egoree eria eraabe yagwereirwe nobomera ase ’nde, Aroni ayerente ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na egoree eria eraabe yagwereirwe nobomera ase Asaseli ayerente ere moyo ase obosio bwane inche Omonene, erinde akore okobwatanigwa asero, na koyetiga esiboire egende ase erooro ase Asaseli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naboigo Aroni arente eeri eria ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe biaye, akore okobwatanigwa asere omonyene, na ase abanto b’enka yaye, anyenye eeri eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio aimokie orogio roichire omorero bw’amakara korwa ase egesasiimero kere ase obosio bwane, n’ekoroso eichire chindoe ibere, ayerente moino y’etoto eria enachete Obomenyo Obochenu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayebeke ase omorero igoro, agwo ase obosio bwane, erinde erioki ria ekoroso eyio ritube Oboikaranso bwa amaabera obore ekemumeko gi’Esanduki ere ne chibao chiriikire oborori. Atakoreti bo, nigo arakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aimokie amanyinga make ay’eeri eyio, ayanyororokerie ase oboikaranso bwa amaabera bosio, na bosio bw’Oboikaranso boria bwa amaabera ara gatano na kabere nekiara kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Magega y’ayio anyenye embori eria ebe ekeng’wanso ase engencho y’ebibe bi’abaanto, aire amanyinga ’embori eyio moino y’etoto eria, ayanyororokerie igoro ase oboikaranso bwa amaabera bosio, na bosio bw’Oboikaranso boria akore buna akorete namanyinga ’eeri eria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo akore okobwatanigwa ase Aase Aachenu Mono ase engencho y’ogotacheneka kw’Abaisraeli amo nogosaria kwabo, na ebibe biabo bionsi. Naende akore okobwatanigwa ase Eema y’Omosangererekano, eyio ere amo nabarabwo na ase egati y’ogotacheneka kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monto onde tatigara ime ase Eema y’Omosangererekano korwa ekero Aroni agosoa ime y’Aase Aachenu Mono akore okobwatanigwa goika arueo, gakoorire gokora okobwatanigwa asere omonyene, na ase abanto b’enka yaye, na ase omosangererekano bwonsi bw’Abaisareli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio asoke agende ase egesasiimero kere agwo ase obosio bwane, agekorere okobwatanigwa, naende aimokie amanyinga make ay’eeri gose ey’embori eyio, ayagindie ase emegwekano yonsi ye ching’unchara ere ase chikoona chi’egesasiimero ekio,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naende anyororokerie egesasiimero namanyinga ayio nekiara kiaye ara gatano na kabere. Ase enchera eyio agesibie na kogechena korwa ase ogotacheneka kore ase Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Embori ere moyo ekoirwa ase erooro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ekero Aroni akoorire gokora okobwatanigwa ase Aase Aachenu Mono, na ase Eema y’Omosangererekano, na ase egesasiimero, arente embori eria ere moyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio goika abeeke amaboko aye abere ase omotwe bw’embori eria ere moyo, aorokie igoro ase embori eyio obobe bwonsi bw’Abaisraeli na ogosaria kwabo gwonsi, na ebibe biabo bionsi. Ase enchera eyio ang’anyie ebio bionsi, abibeke igoro ase omotwe bw’embori eyio. Naende embori eyio eirwe ase erooro nomonto obekirwe ang’e.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo embori eria ebogorie ebibe biabo bionsi, egende nabio gochia ase erooro ase abanto batamanyeti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Magega y’ayio Aroni asoe Eema y’Omosangererekano, arusie chianga chi’egatani chiria abegete ritang’ani atarasoa Aase Aachenu, achitigeo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio esibie omobere oye namaache agwo aase gete are aachenu, naende abeeke chianga chiaye chia botaambe. Magega y’ayio asoke, arue ekeng’wanso ki’ogosaambwa ase engencho yaye ere omonyene amo neki’abaanto bonsi na akore okobwatanigwa asere omonyene na ase abanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende asaambere ebitinya bi’ekeng’wanso keria ki’ebibe ase egesasiimero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oyio oirete embori eria ase erooro ase Asaseli, asibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache; magega y’ayio amanye gosoa ase egetwori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeri eria amo nembori eria chiaruetwe chibe ekeng’wanso ki’ebibe, echio amanyinga abo arentwe ime y’Aase Aachenu Mono akore okobwatanigwa, chiirwe isiko y’egetwori. Riiyo ne risankwa, amo ne chinyama ne chisike chiabo, bisaamberwe aroro n’omorero.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto oria orasaambe ebinto ebio nigo arasibie chianga chiaye, esibie nomobere namaache; magega y’ayio amanye gosoa ase egetwori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Okorendwa kw’erituko ri’Okobwatanigwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Oyo noro omooroberio ochikiire ase more moragenderere korenda botaambe. Rituko ria ikomi, ase omotienyi o gatano na kabere, inamobe mokweng’ata na gweitia; timokora emeremo ende yonsi, inwe abanyene, gose abamenyi bamenyete ase egati yaino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase rituko erio okobwatanigwa ngokorwe ase more ase okobasibia korwa ase ebibe biaino bionsi, nainwe namocheneke ase obosio bwane inche Omonene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko erio naribe richenu mono ase more, rituko ri’ogotimoka, na inwe namweng’ate. Oyio nomoroberio ochiikirwe oragenderere botaambe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omokuani oakirwe amaguta na gwatananwa abe Omokuani ribaga ria ise, nere orakore okobwatanigwa okwo. Ere nigo arabeeke chianga chiria chinchenu chi’egatani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na akore okobwatanigwa ase Aase Aachenu Mono, na ase Eema y’Omosangererekano, naende akore okobwatanigwa ase abakuani, na ase omosangererekano bw’Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoroberio oyio ochiikirwe ase more oragenderere botaambe, ng’a okobwatanigwa kobe kogokorerwa ase Abaisraeli ara rimo ase omwaka ase okobachena korwa ase ebibe biabo bionsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Musa agakora buna Omonene amochiigete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
